    {"en":"“It was not a mistake,” said Harry angrily, “it had my cupboard on it.”","zh":"“根本不是弄错了，”哈利愤怒地说，“上面写着我的碗柜呢。”","audio":"./audio/dale-ch3/0115.mp3","links":[[8,11,1,5],[14,21,5,8],[24,28,15,16],[29,34,10,12],[35,42,12,15],[48,51,20,22],[55,63,24,26]]}
